        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, liquefied, production ID, at freight ship</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, liquefied, production ID, at freight ship
The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas. The net calorific value of natural gas is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=e7b8b5bc-7e01-31ee-af47-2719962b3287
This dataset describes the transport of natural gas on a freight ship between the liquefaction plant in ID and a Thai evaporation plant.
Location: not known
Technology: The distances between liquefaction and evaporation plant is based on port distances.
Time period: Transport modes investigated for 2023.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e7b8b5bc-7e01-31ee-af47-2719962b3287.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
